'''Dogumaru''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]] and can be unlocked at a 30% chance when beating [[Primitive Souls]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] grants [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] target, more health, reduced recharge time, Colossus Slayer and Behemoth Slayer.

